XPath Injection and Unauthorized Data Access The function constructs an XPath query using untrusted username/password inputs without proper sanitization, enabling attackers to inject malicious XPath expressions and access unauthorized data., Improper Memory Management and Use-After-Free The function may allocate memory for strings but fail to duplicate them properly, leading to use-after-free vulnerabilities if the XML parser frees the underlying memory before the struct is freed.

